{
  "_readme": "Button bindings. keys = keyboard and mouse, pad = controller (Xbox names). Several actions may share a button: the game picks by context (ball carrier, defender, QB who can still pass, before the snap). Modifiers: Shift+Q, Ctrl+Q, Alt+Q. Mouse: MouseLeft, MouseRight, MouseMiddle, Mouse4, Mouse5. Pad: A B X Y LB RB LT RT L3 R3 Back Start DpadUp DpadDown DpadLeft DpadRight, sticks LeftX- LeftX+ LeftY- LeftY+ RightX- RightX+ RightY- RightY+. Pressing the two hand buttons together (within input.chord_window_s in tuning.json) is truck with the ball and dive without. F5 reloads this file.",
  "actions": {
